# Staged bundled Zornux runtime — published binaries; the placeholder README stays.
# win-x64 is vendored so CI bundles the toolchain into the Windows installer.
build/zornux/*/
!build/zornux/win-x64/

# Leaked self-test artifacts. Under ZNXSTUDIO_SELFTEST the coordinator writes scratch
# projects to the OS temp dir; on Windows a mis-joined path can materialize a literal
# `C:\Users\...\AppData\...` name inside the repo root. Those names are illegal on NTFS,
# so committing them aborts every Windows checkout. Never track them.
/C:*
